  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast overshoots following sharp price spikes (e.g., >70% above recent mean) by 10-20% in next 5-7 days.",
    "Adjust downward for persistent sentiment negativity (sentiment < 0.0) by 5-15% in 3-5 day horizon.",
    "Apply mean reversion correction: if forecast deviates >1.5σ from 30-day moving average, revert toward mean by 5-10% over next 7 days.",
    "Increase downward bias for forecasts with sentiment >0.5 and true outcome <65.00 (e.g., 2024-09-05, 2024-09-06).",
    "Correct for lagged overreaction: if model forecasts peak 3-5 days after true peak, reduce by 5-10% to align with actual momentum.",
    "For sentiment history with 0.00, avoid overconfidence in upward trends — cap forecast growth at 5% above prior 15-day average."
  ]
